{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1396189-examples-of-nimbus","id":1396189,"title":"Examples of Nimbus","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-13T10:20:40-07:00","id":1396189,"title":"Examples of Nimbus","content":"I'm relatively new with MtAw, and will admit the vague description and few examples for Nimbus (Nimbi?I have no clue what the plural form would be) my group and I are having a hard time creating them. So I am hoping that this forum would be kind enough to help me out with making some. Several (the more the merrier, a literal PLETHORA) would be amazing. And by Nimbus I am talking bout all three types, to be clear lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12207-mahjemm01","name":"Mahjemm01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-17T19:36:15-07:00","id":1397202,"title":"","content":"Bob the Obrimos <br /> <b>Primary Symbolism:</b> Electrifying Air<br /> <b>Long Term Nimbii</b> tend to be dominated by path but I would be sure to make it reflect the personal themes a bit. In this case, exciting situations would be a bit more common.Not always bad, either.<br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus:</b> A feeling of raw potential accompanies the smell of ozone and a literal crackling halo of electricity.<br /> <b>Nimbus Tilt:</b> Penalty to Composure, Melee, and Athletics as forces and emotions build up faster than normal. (Loop through in that order as Gnosis improves)<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus:</b> A smell of ozone and signs of electricity and heat <br /> <br /> Richard the Mastigos<br /> <b>Primary Symbolism:</b> Air of Desire<br /> <b>Long Term:</b> Finds people who either buy into or oppose his schtick.<br /> <b>Immediate:</b> A rush of sexual energy, some of which is always directed towards Mack, spikes. There's a sensation of gentle touches which is, of course, usually creepy.<br /> <b>Nimbus Tilt:</b> Penalty to Composure. <br /> <b>Signature:</b> Smells like old sex. Has some yellowing.<br /> <br /> Blood the Thyrsus<br /> <b>Primary Symbolism:</b> Heartbeat<br /> <b>Long Term:</b> High pressure situations appear around them<br /> <b>Immediate:</b> Blood's heartbeat is audible and everyone cannot help but hear and feel their heart beating. <br /> <b>Nimbus Tilt:</b> Bonus to Wits and Dexterity<br /> <b>Signature:</b> Signs of a blood splatter","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-17T22:44:34-07:00","id":1397241,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#C5B358\">Z3R0 the V01D (Moros)</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><b>Long Term:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Future </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">designs </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">seem</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> imminent </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">and </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">daunting</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Machine</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">\u2019</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">s function</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">s </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">are</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> improved. </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Haunts and ghosts quiet</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> in </span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">expectation</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Digital and analog displays glitch strange formulas, numbers or countdowns. </span></span> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Immediate: </span></b><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">The gravity of inspiration </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">comes crashing </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">down</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">. </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Objects appear cleaner, glossy and newer. A </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">moment</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> of change both frightening and exhilarating hangs in the air. </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">The formula</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">s, </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">numbers </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">and </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">countdown</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">s</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> reach their terminal point. </span></span></span> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Signature:</span></b><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">A sense of awe and </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">wonder </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">linger</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> behind</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">. </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Devices feel more appealing and user friendly. </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">B</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">ittersweet memories </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">of </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">end</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">ing</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">s </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">come unbidden</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">. </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">The displays </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">leave </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">answering </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">patterns </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">to unknown questions, zeroes or circles. </span></span></span> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Tilt </span></b><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Intelligence </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">and Presence </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">gains a +1 bonus</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">.</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Crafts </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">and Expression </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">gain the 8-again quality while Composure suffers a -1 penalty. Z3R0\u2019s Nimbus </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">grants people </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">more </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">self-confidence</span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"> and greater insights, </span></span><span style=\"color:windowtext\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">makes devices and objects easier to use or create, but a sense of disquiet comes over those who felt secure in the permanence of their world.</span></span></span> </span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Things need not have happened to be true. Tales and dreams are the shadow truths that will endure when mere facts are dust and ashes, and forgot.&quot; Sandman (Neil Gaiman)","edited":{"userid":733,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/733-troller","user":"Troller","date":". 06-18-2020, 01:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/733-troller","name":"Troller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-18T09:37:41-07:00","id":1397314,"title":"","content":"These are great. Definitely help with the group. Keep bringing them lol. Like I said the more the merrier lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12207-mahjemm01","name":"Mahjemm01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-19T22:38:17-07:00","id":1397625,"title":"","content":"Merlin the Acanthus<br /> <b>Long Term:</b> Tend to run into people with weird destinies and Fey links.<br /> <b>Immediate:</b> The strong smell of wood fires, burning oils, and iron accompany a distinct feeling of misplaced time.<br /> <b>Signature:</b> Lingering smell of iron and, sometimes, an oily ash smudge<br /> <b>Tilt:</b> Bonus: Animal Ken, Penalty: Wits","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T17:49:55-07:00","id":1400218,"title":"","content":"I enjoy these Nimbi (sp?). Hoping to get several more to help the Cabal completely flesh theirs out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12207-mahjemm01","name":"Mahjemm01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T21:33:01-07:00","id":1400243,"title":"","content":"I don't really go here [I love Mage, I just don't have much to share], but here are some for different starting characters I've messed around with.<br /> <br /> <u>Beacon</u><br /> <i>Obrimos, Mysterium, Gnosis 1, Potent Nimbus 1</i><br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus:</b> Beacon's immediate Nimbus is blinding, as if she were a star condensed into a human shape. Rays of celestial light cascade from her form, burning away all darkness.<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus:</b> Everything touched by her Nimbus glows brightly from within, as if it were heated metal or simply just radioactive.<br /> <b>Long-term Nimbus:</b> Beacon's long-term Nimbus propagates knowledge, bringing others exactly the information they seek. Revelation and enlightenment spiral out from her.<br /> <b>Tilt:</b> -2 Wits<br /> <br /> <u>Drowned</u><br /> <i>Water-Wise [Neolithic Moros], Gnosis 2, Potent Nimbus 2</i><br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus:</b> Drowned's immediate Nimbus manifests as an oppressive, murky haze, as if underwater, accompanied by the panicked sensation of drowning.<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus:</b> Her signature Nimbus is waterlogged, and smells of rot.<br /> <b>Long-term Nimbus:</b> Drowned's long-term Nimbus claims the old. Around her, weathered buildings succumb to water damage, rivers consume their banks, and her elders stumble into streams and ponds.<br /> <b>Tilt:</b> 8-again on Athletics rolls, -1 Wits and Composure<br /> <br /> <u>Ecstasy</u><br /> <i>Mastigos, Free Council, Gnosis 1</i><br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus:</b> Ecstasy's immediate Nimbus is an iridescent green haze billowing from her mouth. Within the haze, viewers see scenes of the hedonistic debauchery they lust for.<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus:</b> Her signature Nimbus covers objects in beads of green condensation that smell like the observer's guilty pleasure. One person might smell his favorite brand of cigarette, while another scents lemon-lime soda.<br /> <b>Long-term Nimbus:</b> Ecstasy's long-term Nimbus gives people what they want, encouraging revelry.<br /> <b>Tilt:</b> -1 Composure<br /> <br /> If you have it, <b>Nameless and Accursed</b> has a lot of great Nimbus examples. In fact, it was largely why I recently gave a signature and long-term Nimbus to each of these characters [since I have never actually played any of them].","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Posting gives me anxiety, but I'm still happy to be here</i><br /> Habitual Lurker, Vengrel Liker, Acolyte Apologist, She/Her","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25955-somethingfishy","name":"SomethingFishy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25955_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-16T12:25:40-07:00","id":1403142,"title":"","content":"<u>Fenris<i> (Mastigos)</i></u><br /> <b>Primary Theme: </b>Shattering the chains that bind you.<br /> <b>Long-term Nimbus: </b>People forced into situations they don't approve become more rebellious and hostile.<br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus: </b>Blinding rage accompanied with the feeling of invisible bindings scrapping against your body.<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus: </b>Weak smell of iron and sweat.<br /> <b>Nimbus Tilt: </b>Bonus to Strength and Athletics, Penalty to Dexterity and Wits.<br /> <br /> <u>Parsec (Mastigos)</u><br /> <b>Primary Theme: </b>Distance<br /> <b>Long-term Nimbus: </b>Weakens relations between people. Friends lose contact, lovers fall out of love with each other, mortal enemies get less angry against each other. People rarely interact face-to-face, preferring other means of contact such as phones or conference calls.<br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus: </b>Space around the mage seems to stretch. Distances between people and objects grow. Intense feelings mellow out.<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus: </b>Objects touched by the Nimbus appear a bit farther than they really are, which makes handling them tricky.<br /> <b>Nimbus Tilt: </b>Penalty to Dexterity, bonus to Composure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13425-gantolandon","name":"Gantolandon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-21T21:28:56-07:00","id":1409693,"title":"","content":"Saraf (Obrimos)<br /> <b>Symbolism: </b>Magic is the true expression of humanity and a gift from God.<br /> <b>Long-Term Nimbus: </b>People become touched by heavenly grace, experience feelings of determination.<br /> <b>Immediate Nimbus: </b>Three pairs of golden wings, made from the stuff of Prime, appear on Thayleon's back: two wings cover his eyes, two are wide open and two cover his feet. When that happens, a distant thunder echoes on the skies above.<br /> <b>Signature Nimbus: </b>Scorched can be found on the Nimbus' area.<br /> <b>Nimbus Tilt: </b>Bonus to Resolve<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26032-pirategbl","name":"pirategbl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26032_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}